{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04130","headline":"赠刘舍人古意 · 徐彦伯","name":"赠刘舍人古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女牀閟灵鸟，文章世所希。\n巢君碧梧树，舞君青琐闱。\n或言凤池乐，抚翼更西飞。\n凤池环禁林，仙阁霭沈沈。\n璇题激流日，珠缀緜清阴。\n郁穆丝言重，荧煌台座深。\n风张丹戺翮，月弄紫庭音。\n衆彩结不散，孤英跂莫寻。\n浩歌在西省，经传恣潜心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}